# AGENTS.md — {contest_name}

A contest worked on by an AI software house. Read this first, whatever tool you are.

- `HOUSE_DIR` = `{house_dir}`: contest state (spec, decisions, questions, tasks, reports). Use this absolute
  path everywhere, also from git worktrees.
- `HOUSE_ROOT` = `{house_root}`: the house system (`$HOUSE_ROOT/bin/house`, `$HOUSE_ROOT/bin/codex-task`).

## Start of every session
1. Read `HOUSE_DIR/spec.yaml`, `DECISIONS.md`, open entries in `QUESTIONS.md`, `tools.json`.
2. Read `HOUSE_DIR/playbooks/lifecycle.md` and the playbook for `spec.kind` (`build.md` / `optimize.md`).
3. The human just arrived or says "jak tam": follow `HOUSE_DIR/protocols/briefing.md` first.

